      "content": "The shame you're feeling is a very heavy burden, and it's real, but those feelings often become much louder than the actual situation. Please know that many successful people face significant setbacks, and your worth is not tied to the image you project for others. Would you be open to talking about ways to start rebuilding your internal sense of self, separate from your professional success?",
