      "content": "rebuilding... how am i even supposed to do that? there's nothing left to build with. everything i worked for was tied to that life. once that's gone, the version of me everyone loves is gone too. i feel like it's better to just... not have to face the humiliation. to just end the descent before i have to face the reality of being nothing. it feels like the only way to keep some shred of dignity left.",
